<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LIISING TO ISSUE NEW COMMERICIAL PAPERS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LIISING TO ISSUE NEW COMMERICIAL PAPERS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa liising, the leasing arm of the Hansapank group, will issue 47-day commerical papers worth 40 million kroons on Wednesday, May 28, Hansapank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The commerical papers will have a yield of seven percent, Ulo Kallas, Hansapank interest products manager, told Reuters.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
